 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "transactions is an unordered list of rows [transactionId, userId, adDeliveryPennies, paymentPennies, transactionTimestamp] of strings; amounts are decimal integer strings or \"\" (missing, treated as 0) and the timestamp is a decimal integer string. A row adds its ad-delivery amount to the user's balance and subtracts its payment amount. Level 3: replay each user's rows in chronological order (timestamp ascending, ties by transactionId in code-point order), starting from balance 0. Return [userId, finalBalance, peakBalance] for every user, where peakBalance is the largest balance reached after any of the user's rows, or 0 if it never rises above 0; users sorted by userId in code-point order.",
  "provenance": [
